  "catalogSteamStatusNote": "Tested in Bodega on 2026-11-04 (M2 Pro, macOS 27.0.1): it installs, opens, signs in, downloads and launches games. Muck (D3D11) ran with DXMT. Games with Easy Anti-Cheat, such as POLYGON, don't start.",
